{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2023-06-22 16:05:00', 'title': 'MODERNA FILES FOR FDA AUTHORIZATION OF ITS UPDATED COVID-19 VACCINE', 'text': 'PRELIMINARY CLINICAL DATA DEMONSTRATED A ROBUST IMMUNE RESPONSE BY THE COMPANY\'S XBB.1.5 MONOVALENT VACCINE AGAINST XBB DESCENDENT LINEAGE VIRUSES PENDING AUTHORIZATION, MODERNA\'S UPDATED COVID-19 VACCINE WOULD BE AVAILABLE IN TIME FOR FALL VACCINATION SUPPLY READINESS FOLLOWS MONTHS OF MANUFACTURING TO ENSURE TIMELY AND AMPLE SUPPLY CAMBRIDGE, MA / ACCESSWIRE / JUNE 22, 2023 / MODERNA, INC. (NASDAQ:MRNA), A BIOTECHNOLOGY COMPANY PIONEERING MESSENGER RNA (MRNA) THERAPEUTICS AND VACCINES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED SUBMISSION OF A REGULATORY APPLICATION TO THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION FOR ITS UPDATED COVID-19 VACCINE CONTAINING SPIKE PROTEINS FOR THE XBB.1.5 SUBLINEAGE OF SARS-COV-2 (MRNA-1273.815). "THE AGILITY OF OUR MRNA PLATFORM HAS ENABLED US TO UPDATE SPIKEVAX, MODERNA\'S COVID-19 VACCINE, TO TARGET XBB VARIANTS WITH SPEED AND CLINICAL RIGOR," SAID STÉPHANE BANCEL, CEO OF MODERNA.'}